    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST E-Way Bills:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">GST (Goods and Services Tax) E-Way Bills are mandatory when transporting goods between two states in India. They are electronic documents that serve as proof of the movement of goods and provide details such as sender, receiver, goods description, and value.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
